{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 5453695351695224956,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Autodiff CI job",
      "source_hash": 10142057783763681715,
      "context_hash": 9153524923475089887,
      "translation": "Autodiff CI 작업",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490161Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The [`optional-test-x86_64-gnu-autodiff`] job provides continuous test coverage for the experimental `autodiff` feature and its integration with LLVM Enzyme.",
      "source_hash": 9847853023156594833,
      "context_hash": 7125325353819877063,
      "translation": "[`optional-test-x86_64-gnu-autodiff`] 작업은 실험적인 `autodiff` 기능과 LLVM Enzyme와의 통합에 대한 지속적인 테스트 커버리지를 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490162Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It is an optional [auto job](./ci.md#auto-builds), so a failure does not prevent a pull request from being merged.",
      "source_hash": 17990706980257608136,
      "context_hash": 4694103904661216801,
      "translation": "이는 선택적 [auto job](./ci.md#auto-builds)이므로, 실패하더라도 풀 리퀘스트 병합을 막지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490162Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "For more context about the feature, see the [autodiff tracking issue] and the [autodiff internals](../autodiff/internals.md) chapter.",
      "source_hash": 7198019366552181454,
      "context_hash": 13843219381724373870,
      "translation": "해당 기능에 대한 더 많은 배경 정보는 [autodiff tracking issue]와 [autodiff internals](../autodiff/internals.md) 챕터를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490162Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What is tested",
      "source_hash": 9244793778781295069,
      "context_hash": 1748738452031903544,
      "translation": "테스트 대상",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490162Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The job checks:",
      "source_hash": 10462835737297400220,
      "context_hash": 3435077308196187731,
      "translation": "이 작업은 다음을 확인합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490162Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "forward- and reverse-mode macro expansion and diagnostics;",
      "source_hash": 8224438048075742617,
      "context_hash": 2719909232304687,
      "translation": "순방향 및 역방향 모드 매크로 확장과 진단;",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490162Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "LLVM IR generation for autodiff;",
      "source_hash": 2097947579762089110,
      "context_hash": 15955667314971679098,
      "translation": "autodiff를 위한 LLVM IR 생성;",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490162Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "enforcement of the `autodiff` feature gate.",
      "source_hash": 16659395212827850292,
      "context_hash": 12563837717375743586,
      "translation": "`autodiff` 기능 게이트의 강제 적용.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490162Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Running the job",
      "source_hash": 13434250010738630933,
      "context_hash": 21414401912866268,
      "translation": "작업 실행하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490162Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "To run the job in a try build, comment on a pull request:",
      "source_hash": 17156943813613821814,
      "context_hash": 8367191879339068628,
      "translation": "try 빌드에서 이 작업을 실행하려면, 풀 리퀘스트에 다음과 같이 댓글을 다십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490162Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "To run the job locally, run this command from a Rust checkout:",
      "source_hash": 8803688098400609074,
      "context_hash": 2638311983160413030,
      "translation": "로컬에서 이 작업을 실행하려면, Rust 체크아웃에서 다음 명령을 실행하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490162Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "See [Testing with Docker](./docker.md) for more information about running CI jobs locally.",
      "source_hash": 9652190792316039616,
      "context_hash": 4700902015557639320,
      "translation": "로컬에서 CI 작업을 실행하는 방법에 대한 더 많은 정보는 [Testing with Docker](./docker.md)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490163Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Point of contact",
      "source_hash": 16174917019327058563,
      "context_hash": 3384992628165157991,
      "translation": "담당자",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490163Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "If you have questions or need help with a failure in this job, open a new topic in the [autodiff Zulip channel].",
      "source_hash": 14235521145519514413,
      "context_hash": 8284488606662190265,
      "translation": "이 작업에서 발생한 실패에 대해 질문이 있거나 도움이 필요한 경우, [autodiff Zulip channel]에 새 토픽을 여십시오. Enzyme 백엔드 실패가 의심되는 경우에는 [autodiff debugging guide]를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490163Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For suspected Enzyme backend failures, see the [autodiff debugging guide].",
      "source_hash": 12323410305484126415,
      "context_hash": 7282025745131142964,
      "translation": "Enzyme 백엔드 실패로 의심되는 경우 [autodiff debugging guide]를 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:09:55.490163Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}